{"id":"n61051-2-7","stage":4,"title":"브레이크 · 刹车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61051-2-7-1","ko":"갑자기 비가 쏟아지네?","zh":"怎么突然下起大雨来了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"쏟아지네?","meaning":"倾泻，下大","explanation":"쏟아지다：倾泻，下大；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쏟아지다","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71284","senseId":"4","lemma":"쏟아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏟아지네","audio":"/audio/929f923d7afca5cecdc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"f4ace1873bdada0b","term":"쏟아지다","zh":"倾泻，下大","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3","entryId":"71284","definition":"雨或雪一下子下很多，或阳光暴晒。","pronunciation":["쏘다지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a1fd261893c0980db37.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61051-2-7-2","ko":"소풍을 가려던 우리 계획에 브레이크가 걸렸군.","zh":"我们本来打算去野餐的计划可要泡汤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소풍을","meaning":"远足，郊游，野游","explanation":"소풍：远足，郊游，野游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소풍","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26854","senseId":"1","lemma":"소풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소풍을","audio":"/audio/c4a7007301a0b521ee0e.mp3"}},{"text":"가려던","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；려던：表示过去正打算做的动作，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려던","audio":"/audio/65c38eb6b73dfabc6d6b.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"계획에","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획에","audio":"/audio/c5df3198f368c9ff4f5a.mp3"}},{"text":"브레이크가","meaning":"刹车，叫停","explanation":"브레이크：刹车，叫停；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"브레이크","audio":"/audio/d0d3a184998c0a9862ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61051","senseId":"2","lemma":"브레이크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"브레이크가","audio":"/audio/a1f14702003e096726b6.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸군.","meaning":"卡，噎，挂","explanation":"걸리다：卡，噎，挂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"9","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸군","audio":"/audio/32c0dcfb043f9ee13c49.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"687c92f20434bf39","term":"소풍","zh":"远足，郊游，野游","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3","entryId":"26854","definition":"为了享受美景或做游戏而去野外。","pronunciation":["소풍"]},{"id":"233